  rintro ⟨e3, pc3⟩ ⟨hpc3, hrbx3, hrdx3, hrdi3, hrsp3, hrbp3, hk3, Hm3⟩
  dsimp only at hpc3 hrbx3 hrdx3 hrdi3 hrsp3 hrbp3 hk3 Hm3
  subst hpc3
  obtain ⟨⟨rax3, rbx3, rcx3, rdx3, rsi3, rdi3, rsp3, rbp3, r83, r93, r103, r113, r123, r133, r143, r153⟩,
